      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Incident (links to VS-27.1); warranty/RMA; preventive maintenance
Frequency: Continuous
Volume: ~thousands of break/fix tickets/year
Owner: IT Operations Manager
Participants: IT Ops Mgr, Service Desk (links to VS-27.1), Field IT, Vendor/Warranty, Finance
Source: workflow W3237 — Asset Maintenance, Break/Fix &amp; Spare Pool Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3237_LaneSet3">
